    "category": "classfeature",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A weapon is perhaps the simplest piece of regalia in terms of symbolism: no matter how ornate it is, it is a tool of war that shows that you are willing to slay others for your court.</p><p><strong>Edicts</strong> Execute those who pose a threat to your court when imprisoning them could lead to further danger.</p><p><strong>Anathema</strong> Flee from a fight you could reasonably win.</p><p><strong>Regalia's Gift</strong> Your weapon is more powerful than others of its kind. Increase its damage die size by one step, to a maximum of d12.</p><p><em>Setup:</em> you pick the weapon from your inventory when this feature is added. If you didn't own it yet, delete this feature and drag it back on from the Sovereign Class Features compendium.</p>"
